triggerVolumeEffectEditor.field.Teleport.Position.tooltip = Destination position for the entity. When Relative to Entity is enabled, this is added as a world-space offset from the triggering entity.
triggerVolumeEffectEditor.field.Teleport.World.tooltip = Optional destination world. Leave empty to use the current world.
triggerVolumeEffectEditor.field.Teleport.ResetVelocity.tooltip = Reset entity velocity after teleporting.
triggerVolumeEffectEditor.field.Teleport.RelativeToEntity.tooltip = Add Position to the triggering entity's current world position instead of using Position as an absolute destination.
triggerVolumeEffectEditor.field.Teleport.UseRotation.tooltip = Apply the configured Rotation after teleporting. When off, the entity keeps its current rotation.
triggerVolumeEffectEditor.field.Teleport.Rotation.tooltip = Yaw, pitch, and roll in degrees used when Use Rotation is enabled.
triggerVolumeEffectEditor.field.SendMessage.Message.tooltip = Message sent to the chosen Recipient. Insert a volume tag's value with {tagName} (using the tag's key). Unknown placeholders are left as written.
triggerVolumeEffectEditor.field.PlaySound.SoundEvent.tooltip = Sound event asset to play.
triggerVolumeEffectEditor.field.PlaySound.Volume.tooltip = Sound playback volume multiplier.
triggerVolumeEffectEditor.field.PlaySound.Pitch.tooltip = Sound playback pitch multiplier.
triggerVolumeEffectEditor.field.SetVelocity.Velocity.tooltip = Velocity applied to the triggering entity.
triggerVolumeEffectEditor.field.SetVelocity.Additive.tooltip = Add this velocity to the entity's current velocity instead of replacing it.
triggerVolumeEffectEditor.field.SetVelocity.RelativeMode.tooltip = Interpret Velocity as world-space, horizontal-facing-relative, or full-look-relative.
triggerVolumeEffectEditor.field.PermissionCondition.Permission.tooltip = Required permission node for the triggering player.
triggerVolumeEffectEditor.field.CooldownCondition.Cooldown.tooltip = Seconds between accepted triggers. 0 disables the cooldown.
triggerVolumeEffectEditor.field.CooldownCondition.Scope.tooltip = Per Player tracks each player separately. Whole Volume shares one timer for the condition.
triggerVolumeEffectEditor.field.GameModeCondition.GameMode.tooltip = Required game mode for the triggering player.
triggerVolumeEffectEditor.field.ItemCondition.Item.tooltip = Required item id.
triggerVolumeEffectEditor.field.ItemCondition.Location.tooltip = Where to check for the item.
triggerVolumeEffectEditor.field.ItemCondition.Quantity.tooltip = Minimum matching item quantity required.
triggerVolumeEffectEditor.field.ItemCondition.Consume.tooltip = Remove the matching item quantity when this condition passes.
triggerVolumeEffectEditor.field.RandomChanceCondition.Chance.tooltip = Acceptance chance from 0 to 1.
triggerVolumeEffectEditor.field.PlayerCountCondition.Comparison.tooltip = How the live player count is compared against the configured value.
triggerVolumeEffectEditor.field.PlayerCountCondition.Count.tooltip = Number of players to compare against. Counts every player currently inside this volume, or every player across the group on group-level events.
triggerVolumeEffectEditor.field.TagCondition.Source.tooltip = Where to check for the tag: the tag event payload, this volume, the current group/spatial set, or a radius search.
triggerVolumeEffectEditor.field.TagCondition.TagKey.tooltip = Tag key required on the selected source, or the event tag key when Source is Event.
triggerVolumeEffectEditor.field.TagCondition.TagValue.tooltip = Optional tag value required under Tag Key. Blank matches any value for that key.
triggerVolumeEffectEditor.field.TagCondition.MatchKey.tooltip = Used only when Source is Radius. Optional tag key used to choose candidate volumes. Blank includes every volume in the radius.
triggerVolumeEffectEditor.field.TagCondition.MatchValue.tooltip = Used only when Source is Radius. Optional value required under Match Tag Key. Blank matches any value for that key.
triggerVolumeEffectEditor.field.TagCondition.Radius.tooltip = Used only when Source is Radius. Maximum distance from the chosen center. 0 searches the entire world.
triggerVolumeEffectEditor.field.TagCondition.Center.tooltip = Used only when Source is Radius. Center position used for the radius search.
triggerVolumeEffectEditor.field.TagCondition.MinimumCount.tooltip = Used only when Source is Group or Radius. If greater than 0, this many candidate volumes must have Tag Key instead of requiring every candidate volume.
triggerVolumeEffectEditor.field.BlockTypeCondition.BlockType.tooltip = Block type assets to match. Matched against the block's base type, so stateful blocks still match when their base type is selected. Leave empty to match any block. Use the picker multiple times to add more than one.
triggerVolumeEffectEditor.field.EntityEffect.Effect.tooltip = Entity effect asset to apply or remove.
triggerVolumeEffectEditor.field.EntityEffect.Mode.tooltip = Whether to add, remove, or toggle the entity effect.
triggerVolumeEffectEditor.field.EntityEffect.Duration.tooltip = Duration in seconds for temporary entity effects.
triggerVolumeEffectEditor.field.TriggerNpcMarkers.MarkerType.tooltip = NPC marker type to trigger. Leave empty to trigger every manual marker found in the area.
triggerVolumeEffectEditor.field.TriggerNpcMarkers.Range.tooltip = Extra search radius around each area volume's origin, in blocks. 0 only triggers markers that lie inside the volume shape; any value above 0 also triggers markers within this sphere.
triggerVolumeEffectEditor.field.TriggerNpcMarkers.MatchTag.tooltip = Optional tag used to pick which volumes act as the search area. Empty uses this volume (or every member volume on group-level events).
triggerVolumeEffectEditor.field.TriggerNpcMarkers.Radius.tooltip = Filters Match Tag volumes to those within this distance of Center, in blocks. 0 includes every tagged volume in the world.
triggerVolumeEffectEditor.field.TriggerNpcMarkers.Center.tooltip = What Radius is measured from: this trigger volume's origin or the triggering entity's position.
triggerVolumeEffectEditor.field.PlayVfx.ParticleSystem.tooltip = Particle system asset to spawn.
triggerVolumeEffectEditor.field.PlayVfx.Offset.tooltip = Offset from the entity or volume position.
triggerVolumeEffectEditor.field.PlayVfx.AtEntity.tooltip = [TMP] Spawn at the triggering entity instead of the volume origin.
triggerVolumeEffectEditor.field.PlayVfx.Scale.tooltip = Visual scale multiplier. 1.0 is default.
triggerVolumeEffectEditor.field.PlayVfx.Rotation.tooltip = Yaw/pitch/roll in degrees applied to the particle system.
triggerVolumeEffectEditor.field.PlayVfx.Duration.tooltip = Auto-despawn after this many seconds. 0 lets the particle system run until it ends naturally.
triggerVolumeEffectEditor.field.SetWeather.Weather.tooltip = Weather asset to apply.
triggerVolumeEffectEditor.field.SetWeather.PlayerOnly.tooltip = Apply this weather only to the triggering player.
triggerVolumeEffectEditor.field.SetWeather.ResetWeather.tooltip = Reset the weather instead of applying a new weather asset.
triggerVolumeEffectEditor.field.ShowEventTitle.PrimaryTitle.tooltip = Main title text shown to the player. Insert a volume tag's value with {tagName} (using the tag's key). Unknown placeholders are left as written.
triggerVolumeEffectEditor.field.ShowEventTitle.SecondaryTitle.tooltip = Subtitle text shown below the main title. Insert a volume tag's value with {tagName} (using the tag's key). Unknown placeholders are left as written.
triggerVolumeEffectEditor.field.ShowEventTitle.IsMajor.tooltip = Use the major event title presentation.
triggerVolumeEffectEditor.field.ShowEventTitle.Icon.tooltip = Optional icon asset shown with the title.
triggerVolumeEffectEditor.field.ShowEventTitle.Duration.tooltip = Time in seconds the title remains visible.
triggerVolumeEffectEditor.field.ShowEventTitle.FadeInDuration.tooltip = Fade-in duration in seconds.
triggerVolumeEffectEditor.field.ShowEventTitle.FadeOutDuration.tooltip = Fade-out duration in seconds.
triggerVolumeEffectEditor.field.PastePrefab.PrefabList.tooltip = Prefab list asset used to choose a random prefab.
triggerVolumeEffectEditor.field.PastePrefab.Prefab.tooltip = Specific prefab asset to paste.
triggerVolumeEffectEditor.field.PastePrefab.Position.tooltip = Position used when pasting the prefab.
triggerVolumeEffectEditor.field.PastePrefab.AtVolumeOrigin.tooltip = [TMP] Position adds to the volume origin. When off, Position is treated as absolute world coordinates.
triggerVolumeEffectEditor.field.PastePrefab.ShowParticles.tooltip = Show block particles when the prefab is pasted.
triggerVolumeEffectEditor.pastePrefab.preview.tooltip = Toggle a world-space preview of the prefab at the trigger volume's location.
triggerVolumeEffectEditor.field.ControlDoors.Action.tooltip = Door action to apply.
triggerVolumeEffectEditor.field.DamageEntity.Mode.tooltip = Damage mode used for the triggering entity.
triggerVolumeEffectEditor.field.DamageEntity.Amount.tooltip = Damage amount to apply.
triggerVolumeEffectEditor.field.RunRootInteraction.RootInteraction.tooltip = Root interaction asset to run on the triggering entity.
triggerVolumeEffectEditor.field.RunRootInteraction.InteractionType.tooltip = Which interaction channel to start the chain under. This selects held-item/inventory context, cooldown grouping, and which chains can block or interrupt it - it doesn't check what the entity is currently doing.
triggerVolumeEffectEditor.field.SetMusic.MusicContainer.tooltip = Music container to force for the triggering player.
triggerVolumeEffectEditor.field.SetMusic.ClearMusic.tooltip = Clear this player's forced music and resume world or ambience music.
triggerVolumeEffectEditor.field.GiveItem.Item.tooltip = Item asset to grant to the triggering player.
triggerVolumeEffectEditor.field.GiveItem.Quantity.tooltip = Number of items to grant. Values below 1 are ignored.
triggerVolumeEffectEditor.field.GiveItem.OverflowBehavior.tooltip = What to do when the player's inventory cannot fit the full quantity.
triggerVolumeEffectEditor.field.SetGameMode.GameMode.tooltip = Game mode to set for the triggering player.
triggerVolumeEffectEditor.field.common.MatchKey.tooltip = Tag key to match against. Leave blank to target this volume only.
triggerVolumeEffectEditor.field.common.MatchValue.tooltip = Optional value required under Match Tag Key. Blank matches any value for that key.
triggerVolumeEffectEditor.field.common.Radius.tooltip = Maximum distance from the chosen center. 0 searches the entire world.
triggerVolumeEffectEditor.field.common.Center.tooltip = Center position used for the radius search.
triggerVolumeEffectEditor.field.ModifyTags.Operation.tooltip = How to change the tag on each matched volume. Set and Replace write Tag Value, Remove deletes the key when Tag Value is blank or only removes a matching value, Increment adds a positive or negative number, Toggle flips true/false, and Append adds Tag Value to the existing value.
triggerVolumeEffectEditor.field.ModifyTags.TagKey.tooltip = Tag key to modify on each matched volume.
triggerVolumeEffectEditor.field.ModifyTags.TagValue.tooltip = Value to write, add, or compare. Blank with Set or Replace stores Empty. Blank with Remove deletes the key regardless of its current value.
triggerVolumeEffectEditor.field.ModifyTags.MatchKey.tooltip = Optional tag key used to choose affected volumes. Blank affects this volume.
triggerVolumeEffectEditor.field.ModifyTags.MatchValue.tooltip = Optional value required under Match Tag Key. Blank matches any value for that key.
triggerVolumeEffectEditor.field.PlaceBlock.BlockType.tooltip = Block type asset to place.
triggerVolumeEffectEditor.field.PlaceBlock.Position.tooltip = Position offset or absolute world position, depending on Origin.
triggerVolumeEffectEditor.field.PlaceBlock.Origin.tooltip = How Position is interpreted.
triggerVolumeEffectEditor.field.PlaceBlock.ReplaceMode.tooltip = Whether to replace any block or only place into air.
triggerVolumeEffectEditor.field.ReplaceBlockType.FromBlockTypes.tooltip = Block type assets to replace. Use the picker multiple times to add more than one.
triggerVolumeEffectEditor.field.ReplaceBlockType.ToBlockType.tooltip = Block type asset to place when a matching block is found.
triggerVolumeEffectEditor.field.ReplaceBlockType.Bounds.tooltip = Whether to scan the exact volume shape or the configured AABB.
triggerVolumeEffectEditor.field.ReplaceBlockType.X.tooltip = AABB size along the X axis, starting from Offset.
triggerVolumeEffectEditor.field.ReplaceBlockType.Y.tooltip = AABB size along the Y axis, starting from Offset.
triggerVolumeEffectEditor.field.ReplaceBlockType.Z.tooltip = AABB size along the Z axis, starting from Offset.
triggerVolumeEffectEditor.field.ReplaceBlockType.Offset.tooltip = AABB minimum corner offset from the chosen Origin. Only applies to the AABB bounds mode.
